bers":["Poka\u017c subskrybent\u00f3w"],"Show video details":["Poka\u017c szczeg\u00f3\u0142y filmu"],"Fast and Effective Support":["Szybka i skuteczna pomoc techniczna"],"Always up to date":["Zawsze aktualny stan"],"Get All Access Bundle":["Uzyskaj pakiet z pe\u0142nym dost\u0119pem"],"Our Feeds for other platforms":["Nasze kana\u0142y zwi\u0105zane z innymi platformami"],"Follow Us":["Obserwuj nas"],"Delete %s?":["Usun\u0105\u0107 %s?"],"Are you sure you want to delete this channel?":["Czy na pewno chcesz usun\u0105\u0107 ten kana\u0142?"],"Your license key is inactive":["Tw\u00f3j klucz licencyjny jest nieaktywny"],"No license key detected. Please activate your license key to enable Pro features.":["Nie wykryto klucza licencyjnego. W\u0142\u0105cz klucz licencyjny, aby w\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 funkcje Pro."],"Activate License Key":["W\u0142\u0105cz klucz licencyjny"],"Channel Title":["Tytu\u0142 kana\u0142u"],"Published":["Opublikowano"],"Drafts":["Szkice"],"View All":["Zobacz wszystkie"],"Publish All":["Opublikuj wszystkie"],"Delete All":["Usu\u0144 wszystkie"],"%s of %s":["%s z %s"],"No single videos found":["Nie znaleziono pojedynczych film\u00f3w"],"Couldn't find any videos to import.":["Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 znale\u017a\u0107 film\u00f3w do zaimportowania."],"Import Videos":["Zaimportuj filmy"],"Generate WordPress posts from your YouTube channel. Enter the channel name or ID and the number of videos to import below and click \u201cImport\u201d.":["Wygeneruj wpisy WordPressa ze swojego kana\u0142u na YouTubie. Wpisz poni\u017cej nazw\u0119 lub identyfikator kana\u0142u oraz liczb\u0119 film\u00f3w do zaimportowania i kliknij \u201eImportuj\u201d."],"Channel Name or ID":["Nazwa lub identyfikator kana\u0142u"],"Enter Channel name or ID (for example: voxdotcom)":["Wpisz nazw\u0119 lub identyfikator kana\u0142u (na przyk\u0142ad: voxdotcom)"],"Import":["Importuj"],"Importing \u2022 %s Videos Imported":["Importowanie \u2022 zaimportowanych film\u00f3w: %s"],"Please go to <a href='%s'>Settings<\/a> and enter an API key to activate the importer tool.":["Przejd\u017a do <a href='%s'>ustawie\u0144<\/a> i wpisz klucz API, aby w\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 narz\u0119dzie importu."],"View All Videos":["Zobacz wszystkie filmy"],"Test Connection":["Przetestuj po\u0142\u0105czenie"],"Connection successful":["Po\u0142\u0105czenie nawi\u0105zane"],"Connection failed":["Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 po\u0142\u0105czy\u0107"],"View error":["Zobacz b\u0142\u0105d"],"<span>You are using Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider <a href='%s' target='_blank'>Upgrading to Pro<\/a><\/span>":["<span>U\u017cywasz wersji Lite wtyczki \u2013 do tego nie potrzeba licencji. Mi\u0142ego korzystania! \ud83d\ude42 Aby uzyska\u0107 dost\u0119p do wi\u0119kszej liczby funkcji, rozwa\u017c <a href='%s' target='_blank'>kupno Pro<\/a><\/span>"],"License Key":["Klucz licencyjny"],"Your license key provides access to updates and support":["Klucz licencyjny zapewnia dost\u0119p do aktualizacji i pomocy technicznej"],"Your <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> license is %s":["Twoja licencja <strong>YouTube Feed Pro<\/strong> jest %s"],"<em>Already purchased? Simply enter your license key below to activate YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>":["<em>Zakup dokonany? Wpisz klucz licencyjny poni\u017cej, aby w\u0142\u0105czy\u0107 wtyczk\u0119 YouTube Feeds Pro.<\/em>"],"Enter License Key":["Wpisz klucz licencyjny"],"Manage License":["Zarz\u0105dzaj licencj\u0105"],"Enter API Key":["Wpisz klucz API"],"Connected YouTube Account":["Po\u0142\u0105czone konto na YouTubie"],"This account is used to display channel feeds. It will not affect playlist, favorites, search, livestreams or single videos stream.":["To konto s\u0142u\u017cy do wy\u015bwietlania kana\u0142\u00f3w z tre\u015bciami pochodz\u0105cymi z kana\u0142u na YouTubie. Nie wp\u0142ywa ono na kana\u0142y z list\u0105 odtwarzania, ulubionymi filmami, wyszukiwanym terminem, transmisjami na \u017cywo czy pojedynczymi filmami."],"Feed not working? ":["Kana\u0142 nie dzia\u0142a? "],"Try Re-authenticating connected account":["Spr\u00f3buj ponownie uwierzytelni\u0107 po\u0142\u0105czone konto"],"API Key":["Klucz API"],"Preserve settings if plugin is removed":["Zachowaj ustawienia po usuni\u0119ciu wtyczki"],"This will make sure that all of your feeds and settings are still saved even if the plugin is uninstalled":["Dzi\u0119ki temu wszystkie kana\u0142y i ustawienia zostan\u0105 zachowane w przypadku odinstalowania wtyczki"],"Import Feed Settings":["Zaimportuj ustawienia kana\u0142\u00f3w"],"You will need a JSON file previously exported from the Feeds for YouTube Plugin":["B\u0119dziesz potrzebowa\u0107 pliku JSON wyeksportowanego wcze\u015bniej z wtyczki Feeds for YouTube"],"Export Feed Settings":["Wyeksportuj ustawienia kana\u0142u"],"Select Feed":["Wybierz kana\u0142"],"Export":["Eksportuj"],"Export settings for one or more of your feeds":["Wyeksportuj ustawienia dowolnych kana\u0142\u00f3w"],"Custom Code":["W\u0142asny kod"],"Caching":["Buforowanie"],"1:00":["1:00"],"2:00":["2:00"],"3:00":["3:00"],"4:00":["4:00"],"5:00":["5:00"],"6:00":["6:00"],"7:00":["7:00"],"8:00":["8:00"],"9:00":["9:00"],"10:00":["10:00"],"11:00":["11:00"],"12:00":["12:00"],"Cache cleared successfully.":["Wyczyszczono pami\u0119\u0107 podr\u0119czn\u0105."],"Couldn't clear the cache.":["Nie uda\u0142o si\u0119 wyczy\u015bci\u0107 pami\u0119ci podr\u0119cznej."],"Clear All Caches":["Wyczy\u015b\u0107 wszystkie pami\u0119ci podr\u0119czne"],"Used for showing views. Example: 392k views":["S\u0142u\u017cy do oznaczania wy\u015bwietle\u0144. Przyk\u0142ad: 392 tys. wy\u015bwietle\u0144"],"Ago":["Temu"],"Used for showing time. Example: 3d ago":["S\u0142u\u017cy do oznaczania czasu. Przyk\u0142ad: 3 d temu"],"Used to highlight when a video is streaming live":["S\u0142u\u017cy do sygnalizowania, \u017ce film jest transmitowany na \u017cywo"],"Used to highlight when a video is going to stream live":["S\u0142u\u017cy do sygnalizowania, \u017ce film b\u0119dzie transmitowany na \u017cywo"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 3 minutes 21 seconds":["S\u0142u\u017cy do odznaczania d\u0142ugo\u015bci filmu. Przyk\u0142ad: 3 minuty 21 sekund"],"Used to show length of the video. Example: 1 hour 3 minutes":["S\u0142u\u017cy do oznaczania d\u0142ugo\u015bci filmu. Przyk\u0142ad: 1 godzina 3 minuty"],"To display the call to action":["Wy\u015bwietlanie wezwania do dzia\u0142ania"],"Thousands":["Tysi\u0105ce"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 321K videos":["Tekst u\u017cywany w liczbie wy\u015bwietle\u0144. Przyk\u0142ad: 321 tys. wy\u015bwietle\u0144"],"Millions":["Miliony"],"Used in the number of views. Example: 4.2M videos":["Tekst u\u017cywany w liczbie wy\u015bwietle\u0144. Przyk\u0142ad: 4,2 mln wy\u015bwietle\u0144"],"Custom Text\/Translate":["Tekst w\u0142asny\/t\u0142umaczenie"],"Enter custom text for the words below, or translate it into the language you would like to use.":["Wpisz w\u0142asny tekst odpowiadaj\u0105cy poni\u017cszym s\u0142owom lub przet\u0142umacz je na j\u0119zyk, kt\u00f3rego chcesz u\u017cywa\u0107."],"Original Text":["Tekst oryginalny"],"Custom text\/translation":["Tekst w\u0142asny\/t\u0142umaczenie"],"Context":["Kontekst"],"AJAX theme loading fix":["Popraw wczytywanie motyw\u00f3w AJAX"],"Usage Tracking":["\u015aledzenie u\u017cycia"],"Cron Clear Cache":["Wyczy\u015b\u0107 pami\u0119\u0107 podr\u0119czn\u0105 przez cron"],"If your YouTube feed is not updating, your WordPress installation may have a rare issue with clearing temporary data in your database. Enable this setting to use WordPress cron to clear your feed caches.":["Je\u015bli kana\u0142 YouTube'a si\u0119 nie aktualizuje, w twojej instalacji WordPressa m\u00f3g\u0142 wyst\u0105pi\u0107 rzadki problem z czyszczeniem danych tymczasowych w bazie danych. W\u0142\u0105cz to ustawienie, aby czy\u015bci\u0107 pami\u0119\u0107 podr\u0119czn\u0105 kana\u0142u za pomoc\u0105 funkcji cron WordPressa."],"Enqueue JavaScript in header":["Umie\u015b\u0107 skrypt JavaScript w kolejce w nag\u0142\u00f3wku"],"Add the JavaScript file for the plugin in the header instead of the footer":["Dodaj plik JavaScript zwi\u0105zany z wtyczk\u0105 w sekcji nag\u0142\u00f3wka, a nie stopki"],"Disable WP Posts":["Wy\u0142\u0105cz wpisy WP"],"This will disable the feature that saves each video as a WordPress post.":["To spowoduje wy\u0142\u0105czenie funkcji, kt\u00f3ra zapisuje ka\u017cdy film jako wpis w WordPressie."],"Save new videos as":["Zapisz nowe filmy jako"],"Draft":["Szkic"],"Publish":["Publikacja"],"When you import new videos, they will be saved accordingly":["Gdy zaimportujesz nowe filmy, zostan\u0105 zapisane w odpowiedni spos\u00f3b"],"Information to Display":["Informacje do wy\u015bwietlenia"],"Stats (Like and Comment Count)":["Statystyki (liczba polubie\u0144 i komentarzy)"],"Saved Featured Images":["Zapisane obrazki wyr\u00f3\u017cniaj\u0105ce"],"Enabling this feature will automatically download video thumbnails and assign them as the featured image for a video post created using YouTube Feeds. Image files are stored in your WordPress media library.":["W\u0142\u0105czenie tej funkcji spowoduje automatyczne pobieranie miniatur film\u00f3w i przypisywanie ich jako obrazk\u00f3w wyr\u00f3\u017cniaj\u0105cych do wpis\u00f3w z filmami utworzonych przy u\u017cyciu wtyczki YouTube Feeds. Pliki obrazk\u00f3w s\u0105 przechowywane w multimediach WordPressa."],"Smash Balloon Team":["Zesp\u00f3\u0142 Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["W Smash Balloon tworzymy oprogramowanie, dzi\u0119ki kt\u00f3remu z \u0142atwo\u015bci\u0105 w kilka minut dodasz do swojej witryny internetowej atrakcyjne, responsywne kana\u0142y medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Chcemy sprawi\u0107, by dodawanie kana\u0142\u00f3w medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych do WordPressa by\u0142o niezwykle proste. Koniec ze skomplikowan\u0105 konfiguracj\u0105, brzydkimi wid\u017cetami iframe czy s\u0142abymi wynikami pomiar\u00f3w szybko\u015bci stron."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Nasze wtyczki s\u0105 nie tylko \u0142atwe w u\u017cyciu, ale te\u017c w pe\u0142ni konfigurowalne, niezawodne i szybkie! To w\u0142a\u015bnie dlatego u\u017cywa ich w swoich witrynach ponad 1,6 miliona tak wspania\u0142ych u\u017cytkownik\u00f3w jak ty."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Inne nasze wtyczki do kana\u0142\u00f3w medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych"],"Plugins we recommend":["Polecane wtyczki"],"Search Documentation":["Przeszukaj dokumentacj\u0119"],"Need more support? We\u2019re here to help.":["Potrzebujesz dodatkowego wsparcia? Ch\u0119tnie pomo\u017cemy."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Prze\u015blij zg\u0142oszenie"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Nasz szybki i przyjazny zesp\u00f3\u0142 pomocy technicznej zawsze ch\u0119tnie ci pomo\u017ce!"],"System Info":["Informacje systemowe"],"Collapse":["Zwi\u0144"],"Expand":["Rozwi\u0144"],"Export Settings":["Wyeksportuj ustawienia"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Mo\u017cesz \u0142atwo udost\u0119pni\u0107 ustawienia wtyczki zespo\u0142owi pomocy technicznej"],"Getting Started":["Pierwsze kroki"],"Some helpful resources to get you started":["Nieco zasob\u00f3w, kt\u00f3re pomog\u0105 ci zacz\u0105\u0107"],"More help getting started":["Wi\u0119cej pomocy na pocz\u0105tek"],"Docs & Troubleshooting":["Dokumenty i rozwi\u0105zywanie problem\u00f3w"],"Run into an issue? Check out our help docs.":["Masz problem? Sprawd\u017a nasze dokumenty pomocy."],"View Documentation":["Zobacz dokumentacj\u0119"],"Additional Resources":["Dodatkowe zasoby"],"To help you get the most out of the plugin":["Aby pom\u00f3c ci korzysta\u0107 w pe\u0142ni z mo\u017cliwo\u015bci wtyczki"],"View Blog":["Zobacz blog"],"Creating Your First YouTube Feed":[""],"How do I Find a Channel ID?":[""],"Guide to Creating and Using an API Key":[""],"How do I Embed a Feed Into a Template Directly?":[""],"My Feed is Showing Unlisted Videos":[""],"Can I Change When the Video Plays?":[""],"How Does the Plugin Optimize Page Load Time?":[""],"Troubleshooting 'YouTube Data API has not been used in project'":[""],"Will Feeds For YouTube Work with Caching Plugins?":[""],"Enter or Paste API Key":[""],"Learn more about how to create and add an API Key here":[""],"Connect with an Access Token":[""],"Reviews":[""],"WPChat":[""],"Install WPChat and connect with customers on WhatsApp, Messenger, Telegram & Instagram and more":[""],"WPConsent":[""],"Detect all the plugins that use cookies and sets a consent banner in just a few clicks. Works well with Smash Balloon plugins.":[""],"TikTok":[""],"Convert videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Recheck license":[""],"Congratulations! You have upgraded to Youtube Feed ":[""],"Please update the plugin by clicking the button on the right for changes to take effect":[""],"Update Plugin":[""],"The plugin will be updated to a newer version":[""],"You might want to backup your website before updating the plugin":[""],"Update Anyway":[""],"Entered API Key is invalid. You can double check the API Key or learn more about generating them <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>here<\/a>":[""],"API Key is used to fetch from the YouTube API, and is required for several features to work. <a target='_blank' href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-api-key\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=api-key'>Learn more<\/a>":[""],"No requests will be made to third-party websites. To accommodate this, some features of the plugin will be limited.":[""],"The plugin will function as normal and load videos directly from YouTube.":[""],"detected":[""],"No GDPR consent plugin detected. Install a compatible <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/feeds-for-youtube-gdpr-compliance\/?youtube' target='_blank'>GDPR consent plugin<\/a>, or manually enable the setting to display a GDPR compliant version of the feed to all visitors.":[""],"Activate WPConsent":[""],"Install WPConsent":[""],"Activate WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Install WPConsent for GDPR":[""],"Manage cookie and privacy preference features from a single place. Smash Balloon plugins work great with WPConsent.":[""],"Installing...":[""],"This helps us prevent plugin and theme conflicts by sending a report in the background once per week about your settings and relevant site stats. It does not send sensitive information like access tokens, email addresses, or user info. This will not affect your site performance as well. <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/youtube-feed\/docs\/usage-tracking\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=usage-tracking' target='_blank'>Learn More<\/a>":[""],"The default HTML for the feed can be replaced with custom templates added to your theme's folder. Enable this setting to use these templates. See <a href='https:\/\/smashballoon.com\/doc\/guide-to-creating-custom-templates\/?utm_campaign=youtube-pro&utm_source=settings&utm_medium=custom-templates' target='_blank'>this guide<\/a>.":[""],"Setup":[""],"Let us setup your plugin!":[""],"Bring the power of YouTube videos directly to your site! With an easy setup, you'll have your first feed ready to go in minutes.":[""],"Launch the Setup Wizard":[""],"Welcome Image":[""],"Step":[""],"Exit Setup":[""],"1":[""],"Set up YouTube plugin ":[""],"To be able to fetch your YouTube videos we need a YouTube API key or a connected YouTube account.":[""],"Skip this step":[""],"Add API Key":[""],"Create all feed types (playlist and live streams)":[""],"Display video statistics, comments, and more":[""],"Fetch complete video history":[""],"Learn how to get a YouTube API Key":[""],"OR":[""],"Connect a YouTube account":[""],"Display 20+ videos from any channel":[""],"Cannot fetch playlists, live streams etc.":[""],"Cannot display likes and comments":[""],"Cannot filter out private videos":[""],"Connect YouTube Account Manually":[""],"Cannot connect a YouTube account from the plugin? Generate an access token from our website in a click and paste it below.":[""],"Paste Access Token here":[""],"Access Token entered is not valid":[""],"Generate Access Token":[""],"Add an API Key for YouTube":[""],"For optimal performance, reliability, and to use all feed types and features you will want to enter an API key. It is free to create and only takes a few minutes.":[""],"API key entered is not valid":[""],"API Key added successfully!":[""],"Your access token is added and now you should be able to add any YouTube feeds. You can update and delete it from Settings.":[""],"Okay":[""],"2":[""],"Configure features":[""],"YouTube channel feeds":[""],"Create and edit YouTube feeds":[""],"Downtime Prevention":[""],"Automatically prevents any downtime by cleverly using cache storage":[""],"Video player":[""],"Social Feed Collection":[""],"Install Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok plugins":[""],"Installs Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and TikTok feeds plugins":[""],"Install Reviews Feed and display customer reviews and an overall rating from Google or Yelp.":[""],"Installs Reviews Feed Plugin":[""],"Installs WPChat Plugin":[""],"Pro Features":[""],"Display playlists, live streams and comments":[""],"Show custom playlists, your live streams and video comments":[""],"Show custom end of video action":[""],"Display a customised call to action when a video ends":[""],"Convert Videos to WordPress posts":[""],"Copy all of your videos into WordPress custom posts":[""],"You might also be interested in...":[""],"Enable your favorite features and disable the ones you don\u2019t need":[""],"Install Selected Plugins":[""],"Activate a GDPR plugin":[""],"Install a GDPR plugin":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by activating a plugin today.":[""],"Ensure your social media feeds comply with privacy regulations by installing a plugin today.":[""],"Activate Selected Plugin":[""],"Install Selected Plugin":[""],"WPConsent activated":[""],"WPConsent installed":[""],"Why should I install a GDPR plugin?":[""],"Legal Compliance":[""],"Ensure your website complies with GDPR and other privacy regulations.":[""],"Build Trust":[""],"Show visitors you respect their privacy with transparent cookie consent.":[""],"Easy Management":[""],"Simplify cookie consent and privacy compliance with automated tools.":[""],"Upgrade to Unlock playlists, livestreams, custom actions and much more":[""],"To unlock these features and much more, upgrade to Pro and enter your license key below.":[""],"Upgrade to YouTube Feed Pro":[""],"Upgrade today and ":[""],"(auto-applied at checkout)":[""],"Awesome. You are all set up!":[""],"Here\u2019s an overview of everything that is setup":[""],"Complete Setup Without Upgrading":[""],"Installing":[""],"We\u2019re more than just an Youtube plugin!":[""],"Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":[""]}}}